    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the world of street racing with <i>Urban Shadows Racing\u2122 Tokyo</i>! In this thrilling racing experience, you\u2019ll compete on the neon-lit streets of Tokyo, striving to become the true champion. The city becomes your playground, with tight corners, long straightaways, and challenging tracks that will test your reflexes and control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Urban Shadows Racing\u2122 Tokyo</i>, gameplay focuses on intense races where you must compete against other drivers to be the first to complete laps and reach the finish line. The game offers a wide selection of powerful, fully customizable cars, each with its own strengths and weaknesses. You can adjust your car\u2019s settings, from engine power to handling, aerodynamics, and tire grip, to better match the specific challenges of each track.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, you\u2019ll unlock new cars, upgrade parts, and explore new tracks throughout Tokyo. The game\u2019s realistic physics engine makes every drift, every turn, and every acceleration feel true to life. Mastering drifting through tight corners is key to maintaining speed and gaining an edge over your competitors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396460/extras/dcf372122eb0676ed1efd5b54e73d2a7.poster.avif?t=1739646368\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396460/extras/dcf372122eb0676ed1efd5b54e73d2a7.webm?t=1739646368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396460/extras/dcf372122eb0676ed1efd5b54e73d2a7.mp4?t=1739646368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the world of street racing with <i>Urban Shadows Racing\u2122 Tokyo</i>! In this thrilling racing experience, you\u2019ll compete on the neon-lit streets of Tokyo, striving to become the true champion. The city becomes your playground, with tight corners, long straightaways, and challenging tracks that will test your reflexes and control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Urban Shadows Racing\u2122 Tokyo</i>, gameplay focuses on intense races where you must compete against other drivers to be the first to complete laps and reach the finish line. The game offers a wide selection of powerful, fully customizable cars, each with its own strengths and weaknesses. You can adjust your car\u2019s settings, from engine power to handling, aerodynamics, and tire grip, to better match the specific challenges of each track.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, you\u2019ll unlock new cars, upgrade parts, and explore new tracks throughout Tokyo. The game\u2019s realistic physics engine makes every drift, every turn, and every acceleration feel true to life. Mastering drifting through tight corners is key to maintaining speed and gaining an edge over your competitors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396460/extras/dcf372122eb0676ed1efd5b54e73d2a7.poster.avif?t=1739646368\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396460/extras/dcf372122eb0676ed1efd5b54e73d2a7.webm?t=1739646368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396460/extras/dcf372122eb0676ed1efd5b54e73d2a7.mp4?t=1739646368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
